Package: stcc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: python3-unicorn, hatari
Description: standalone C subset compiler and Devpac assembler for Atari ST
 Linux-hosted compiler with a built-in Motorola 68000 assembler, object format,
 linker and TOS runtime. Generates relocatable Atari ST PRG/TOS/TTP programs.
 This release implements an integer and pointer C89 subset, not full ANSI C89.
 Floating-point arithmetic and by-value aggregate calls are not yet supported.
 Includes stmkdisk to create raw FAT12 floppy images for Hatari and Steem Engine.
